  "body": "Welcome to 74A Priestley Drive, a beautifully presented family home in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after neighbourhoods, where modern comfort, exceptional school zoning and an enviable coastal lifestyle come together.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the home offers a wonderful sense of warmth and space. At its heart is the recently renovated kitchen, thoughtfully designed with quality finishes, generous bench space, excellent storage and stylish new appliances. It is the perfect setting for busy family breakfasts, after-school conversations and relaxed weekend meals with friends.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled, open-plan living and dining areas flow seamlessly from the kitchen, creating an inviting space for everyday family life. Imagine cosy evenings together on the sofa, celebrations around the dining table or a quiet morning coffee as the house slowly wakes.\r\n\r\nComfortable bedrooms, well-appointed bathrooms and practical family-friendly spaces give everyone room to relax and recharge. Beautifully presented and ready to move into, this is a home where you can simply unpack, settle in and begin creating lasting memories.\r\n\r\nFamilies will particularly appreciate the outstanding location. Macleans Primary School is positioned directly behind the property - bringing school wonderfully close to home - while Macleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate are also within easy walking distance. Priestley Drive appears on the published in-zone street lists for both Macleans Primary School and Macleans College. Purchasers should confirm current enrolment-zone details directly with the relevant schools.\r\n\r\nWhen the school and working week is over, the coastal lifestyle truly comes into its own. Spend summer afternoons at Bucklands Beach or Eastern Beach, explore nearby parks and reserves, or meet friends for coffee and dinner at Half Moon Bay Marina. Nearby ferry services also offer a convenient connection to Auckland’s CBD.\r\n\r\nHighland Park Shopping Centre, Howick Village and Botany Town Centre are all within easy reach, while local playgrounds, sporting facilities and everyday amenities add further convenience.\r\n\r\nA double garage provides secure parking and valuable storage, complemented by additional off-street parking in front of the property - an excellent advantage for busy households and visiting guests.\r\n\r\nWhat makes 74A Priestley Drive truly special is the lifestyle it offers: a welcoming home where children can grow, family and friends can gather, and everyday moments become treasured memories.\r\n\r\nModern, inviting and superbly located in the Macleans College zone, with Macleans Primary right at your doorstep - this is more than a place to live. It is a place for your family to feel at home.",
